+| Package / license / profile | `axiomasoft/corex-access-azguard` / MIT / optional integration |
+| Declared constraints | PHP ^8.4, Laravel 12–13, `axiomasoft/corex-access` ^1.0@dev, `axioma-studio/azguard-core` ^0.3 |
+| Stability | `unreleased`; excluded from the release set until AzGuard has a stable publication (D96, Q2) |
+| Composer channel | Consumer owned; the package repository block supports local package testing only |
